g src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59a04964fa5015c3a63740ca00ed1745cdca3ead\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59a04964fa5015c3a63740ca00ed1745cdca3ead\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c418df0b522269027d296977df54da6967466370\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c418df0b522269027d296977df54da6967466370\" data-origin-width=\"313\" data-origin-height=\"527\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2.&#160; 진자의 운동은 생각했던 만큼의 사진이 잘 안나왔어요.&#160;</div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
